{"sections":[],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLImageV10AttributesV6sourceSSvp","title":"source","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"source","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"abstract":[{"text":"The URL for the image file.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLImage\/Attributes-swift.struct\/source","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"source","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Maps to the MusicXML "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"type":"text","text":" attribute."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLImage","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLImage\/Attributes-swift.struct"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlimage\/attributes-swift.struct\/source"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","title":"IvorMXL","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","kind":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLImage/Attributes-swift.struct":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlimage\/attributes-swift.struct","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLImage\/Attributes-swift.struct","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Attributes","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The image-attributes group is used to include graphical images in a score. The required source attribute is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the URL for the image file. The required type attribute is the MIME type for the image file format. Typical"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"choices include application\/postscript, image\/gif, image\/jpeg, image\/png, and image\/tiff. The optional height"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and width attributes are used to size and scale an image. The image should be scaled independently in X and Y"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"if both height and width are specified. If only one attribute is specified, the image should be scaled"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"proportionally to fit in the specified dimension."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Attributes","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MXLImage.Attributes"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLImage":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlimage","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLImage","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLImage","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The image type is used to include graphical images in a score."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLImage","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MXLImage"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLImage/Attributes-swift.struct/source":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLImage\/Attributes-swift.struct\/source","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"source","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The URL for the image file."}],"title":"source","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlimage\/attributes-swift.struct\/source"}}}